---
description: Hard safety and art rules for party-on-your-dock icon theming.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` exactly for Dock/icon themes.

**Never** modify files inside an `.app` bundle (no `.icns` / `Assets.car` / `Info.plist` / resign). Bundle edits break Gatekeeper (“damaged and can’t be opened”).

**Only** apply icons via `fileicon` / `NSWorkspace.setIcon` custom icons. If Dock won’t update, quit apps / flush caches — do not escalate.

**Art:** restyle the logo only on a **transparent** background — no square plates, fake squircles, or full-bleed poster backgrounds.

**Revert:** `./scripts/poyd revert` must fully clear custom icons. Prefer Dock-scoped themes unless the user asks otherwise.
